# ── Exported data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deliberate blanket denial. This repository documents a mortgage lender's LOS
# integration, and API field exports, loan-volume spreadsheets and Postman
# collections live one folder away in OneDrive. Reference material here is
# AUTHORED as markdown, never committed as an export.
#
# If a specific derived file must ever be tracked, add an explicit "!" exception
# in the same commit as a human review. Never `git add -f`.
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.pdf
*.zip
*.har
*.postman_collection.json
*.postman_environment.json

